Package: MusPerSDT
Type: Package
Title: Adaptive 2AFC Signal Detection Testing for Music Signals
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person(given = "CLesimple", family = "", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "you@example.com")
Description: Tools for running adaptive two-alternative forced-choice (2AFC)
    signal detection tests to estimate detection thresholds for soft music
    signals in within-subject, hearing-impaired listener studies. Provides a
    Levitt (1971) transformed up-down staircase (2-down/1-up, 70.7% target) and
    a Bayesian QUEST+/Psi engine behind a common interface, helpers for
    interleaving multiple adaptive tracks (listener x condition x signal), a
    calibration workflow anchored to a 65 dB(A) reference, and a simulated
    observer for testing.
